      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-110423",
      ":question/problem": "The joint CDF of two continuous random variables $X$ and $Y$ is given by\n\n$F(x, y) = {(1 - e^{-x})(1 - e^{-y}),\\begin{vmatrix}x \\ge 0, y \\ge 0 \\\\ 0,\\end{vmatrix}otherwise$.\n\nFind the joint PDF $f(x, y)$ for $x \\ge 0, y \\ge 0$."
